            "url": "https://money.cnn.com/2018/09/19/investing/china-trade-war-yuan-currency/index.html",
            "title": "China trade war: Premier Li Keqiang says Beijing will never devalue ...",
            "snippets": [
              "Premier Li Keqiang said China \"will never go down the path of stimulating exports by devaluing its currency.\"",
              "# China says it will never use its currency as a weapon in the trade war\n## The trade war between China and the United States is intensifying, but Beijing has just taken one potential weapon off the table.\nPremier Li Keqiang told an audience of global executives and policymakers that China would not weaken the yuan to boost trade with the rest of the world.\n\n\"China will never go down the path of stimulating exports by devaluing its currency,\" Chinese Premier Li Keqiang said Wednesday",
